We are hiring a Senior React AI Developer!

Terms: 12 + 12-month contract | EL1 equivalent
Clearance: Baseline Security Clearance required
Location: QLD, ACT, VIC, NSW - Some Work from Home Available

React | TypeScript | AI-Assisted / Frontend Development | Agentic AI Tools 

Our client, a Commonwealth Government organisation whose focus is to provide support to Australian's living with disability, are seeking the experience of a Senior React AI Developer

Duties of the Senior React AI Developer:
Develop, test and maintain modern web applications using React, TypeScript and contemporary frontend engineering practices;
Utilise AI-assisted software development tools to accelerate implementation, testing, troubleshooting, documentation and delivery activities;
Participate in code reviews, testing activities, CI/CD processes and continuous improvement initiatives;
Support the development and ongoing enhancement of reusable components, design systems and shared frontend capabilities.

Skills and Experience Required:
Demonstrated experience developing modern web applications;
Demonstrated experience delivering accessible digital services and applying accessibility standards and inclusive design principles throughout the software development lifecycle;
Experience working with source control, automated testing, CI/CD pipelines and modern software development practices;
Demonstrated experience effectively leveraging contemporary AI-assisted software engineering tools.

Desirable Criteria:
Experience delivering applications using modern frontend ecosystems and tooling;
Experience working with specification-driven or AI-augmented software development approaches;
Experience using agentic development tools and modern AI-assisted development workflows;
Experience working within government, regulated or highly governed delivery environments.

To apply, use the link below.

